#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"gethostid, sethostid - get or set the unique identifier of the current host"
msgstr ""
"gethostid, sethostid - obține sau stabilește identificatorul unic al gazdei "
"curente"

